  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a hybrid BLS‑QLSTM model where LSTM gates are replaced by variational quantum circuits and preceded by a Broad Learning System feature expansion. On three Chinese stock indices (CSI 300, SSEC, CSI 500; 2672 daily samples each), BLS‑QLSTM achieves RMSE values of 51.65, 37.99, and 83.18 respectively and improves directional accuracy up to 0.789 (SSEC) and 0.775 (CSI 500) compared with classical LSTM and QLSTM baselines.",
